#ASSERT `s 1270 FSMA 90A(8) this section affects the matter` `s 1270 FSMA 90A(8)(a) the powers conferred by sections 382 and 384 (restitution orders of the court and requirements of the Authority)` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 1270 FSMA 90A(8) this section affects the matter` `s 1270 FSMA 90A(8)(b) liability for a civil penalty` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 1270 FSMA 90A(8) this section affects the matter` `s 1270 FSMA 90A(8)(c) liability for a criminal offence` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 1270 FSMA 90A(8) this section affects the matter` `s 1270 FSMA 90A(8) another matter` EQUALS NOTHING

